      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Eight sub-tables on p. vi, each given as a part; the sub-headings (Lineal Measurement x2, Area, Capacity, Weights x2) are printed; the last two (Kilogram/Pound, Pound/Kilogram) have no heading, labels in [brackets] supplied by transcriber.",
        "Rows: 3, 3, 3, 4, 3, 4, 20, 20 as printed. No totals.",
        "Part 'Area', row 40.4685, col 'Acre': printed '1' followed by a stray dot (speck), recorded as '1'.",
        "Part 'Weights' (Tonne/Picul), row 0.0500, col 'English Ton (long ton)': printed clearly '0.0402' (0.05 x 0.9842 would be 0.0492) — kept as printed, probable misprint.",
        "Printed layout: Lineal/Lineal/Area in the left column, Capacity/Weights/Weights in the right column, then the two 20-row kg/lb tables side by side."
